{% from "partials/archive-cover.njk" import archiveCover %}
{% set sampleTopics = ["随筆"] %}

<header class="page-intro shell page-intro--split">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVE COVER STUDIO</p>
    <h1>封面樣式</h1>
  </div>
  <p>四款封面使用同一組薄荷、柔黃、霧灰與墨色。CMS 中可分別修改眉標、主標、副標、註記與編號。</p>
</header>

<section class="cover-studio shell section" lang="zh-Hans" aria-label="文字封面樣式預覽">
