    <p>深灰底色与薄荷微光，最接近原本的档案卡。</p>
  </article>

  {% set mistCard = {
    template: "mist",
    eyebrow: "KUSARIUM · FIELD NOTE",
    title: "微光",
    subtitle: "史料随筆",
    note: "MORNING FILE",
    number: "002 / 2026"
  } %}
